{title: Holy Moment}
{artist: Chris McClarney}
{key: C}
{tempo: 94}

{comment: Verse 1}
[C]This is a Holy moment (x4)

{comment: Chorus}
Come with [F]expectation
Everything [C]abandoned
Look and see the [Am]Glory of our [G]God
Lift your voice to [F]heaven
Jesus is our [C]anthem
